  "changelog": "- First release, for Windows and macOS (Ableton Live has no Linux build). Needs KnobDeck with the\n  companion hub, Live 11 or newer, and the KnobDeck Remote Script\n  (github.com/Knobdeck/knobdeck-ableton-companion), which setup copies into Live's User Library.\n- Transport: Play / Stop, Stop, Continue Playing, Arrangement Record, Session Record, MIDI\n  Arrangement Overdub, Automation Arm, Metronome, Loop, Punch In / Out, Capture MIDI, Undo, Redo.\n- Tempo dial (BPM) and Tap Tempo (shows the BPM); Previous / Next Locator, Add / Delete Locator.\n- Mixer: Master Volume and Track Volume dials (dB), Track Pan dial, Mute, Solo and Record Arm for\n  the selected track or a picked one, Selected Track key.\n- Session: Launch Scene (selected or picked), Stop All Clips, Select Track / Select Scene dials,\n  Tracks and Scenes wheels.\n- Device: the selected device's parameters on dials in banks of 8 (Previous / Next Parameter\n  Bank keys, or a fixed bank), Selected Parameter dial, Device On / Off, Selected Device key.\n- Keys follow Live live: transport, switches, tempo, levels, pan, track switches, selection,\n  device and parameter values.",
